{"id":"5fe673ed82ddf4ff","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-bifolded-boolean-function.md","title":"双折叠布尔函数与显式折叠","display":"df-bifolded-boolean-function — 双折叠布尔函数与显式折叠","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-bifolded-boolean-function","aliases":["28-df-bifolded-boolean-function"],"display":"df-bifolded-boolean-function — 双折叠布尔函数与显式折叠","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"Definition 22.26; following discussion","source_printed_pages":"481–482","source_pdf_pages":"507–508","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-bifolded-boolean-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-bifolded-boolean-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bifolded-boolean-function — 双折叠布尔函数与显式折叠"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 22.26; following discussion"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"481–482"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"507–508"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{-1,1\\}^W\\to\\{-1,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{-1,1\\}^W\\to\\{-1,1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-x\">\\(-x\\)</span> 是逐坐标取负，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_W=\\{x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W:x_1=1\\}\">\\(H_W=\\{x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W:x_1=1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:H_W\\to\\{-1,1\\}\">\\(h:H_W\\to\\{-1,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W\">\\(x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bifolded}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W\\quad f(-x)=-f(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Bifolded}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W\\quad f(-x)=-f(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fold}(h)(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}h(x)&amp;x_1=1,\\\\-h(-x)&amp;x_1=-1.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Fold}(h)(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}h(x)&amp;x_1=1,\\\\-h(-x)&amp;x_1=-1.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bifolded}(\\operatorname{Fold}(h)),\\qquad\\operatorname{Bifolded}(f)\\Rightarrow f=\\operatorname{Fold}(f\\!\\upharpoonright H_W).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Bifolded}(\\operatorname{Fold}(h)),\\qquad\\operatorname{Bifolded}(f)\\Rightarrow f=\\operatorname{Fold}(f\\!\\upharpoonright H_W).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两分支互斥并覆盖全部符号向量，且 −x 在第二分支属于 H_W，因此折叠函数良定义。只需保存每对 x,−x 的一个值；没有额外可查询的证明比特。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 22.26; following discussion；印刷页 481–482；PDF 页 507–508。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{-1,1\\}^W\\to\\{-1,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"-x","display":false},{"tex":"H_W=\\{x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W:x_1=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"h:H_W\\to\\{-1,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bifolded}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W\\quad f(-x)=-f(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fold}(h)(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}h(x)&x_1=1,\\\\-h(-x)&x_1=-1.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bifolded}(\\operatorname{Fold}(h)),\\qquad\\operatorname{Bifolded}(f)\\Rightarrow f=\\operatorname{Fold}(f\\!\\upharpoonright H_W).","display":true}],"bytes":1519,"backlinks":[{"id":"6c37c07068c18aeb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$f:\\{-1,1\\}^W\\to\\{-1,1\\}$，假定 $\\operatorname{Bifolded}(f)$，其定义见 [[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]；$\\widehat f(S)$、$\\chi_S$ 见 [[28-df-fourier-transform]]，$S\\subseteq[W]$。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-403","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-csp-instance]]、[[28-df-cl-reduction]]、[[28-df-constraint-graph]]、[[28-df-projection-game]]、[[28-df-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-df-long-code]]、[[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]、[[28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support]]、[[28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test]]、[[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]、[[28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment]]、[[28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget]]、[[28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}